  "content": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://blay09.net/files/brand/gravelminer.png\" alt=\"Gravel Miner\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<p style=\"display: flex;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/requires-balm.png\" alt=\"Requires Balm\" width=\"260\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/sponsor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left: 26px;\" src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/new-patreon.png\" alt=\"Support on Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p>这个模组将通过解决每个人在采矿时遇到的落石问题，使你的采矿之旅更加愉快。</p>\n<p>当你破坏一个方块时，上方任何正在下落的沙砾都会被立即破坏。</p>\n<p>此模组适用于 NeoForge、Fabric 和 Forge。它需要 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/balm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Balm</a>，必须与模组一起安装。</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/features-header.png\" alt=\"Features\" width=\"836\" height=\"40\"></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>在破坏下方的方块时，立即破坏正在下落的沙砾</li>\n<li>可选客户端安装。只有想要使用它的人才需要安装。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/35/764/gravelminerserver.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"470\"></p>",
